# Routine "Friday open threads review": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every Friday morning, the open threads and next steps across your accounts, with what has gone stale and what closed this week.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/account-book && pi -p "/friday-open-threads-review"
